{"fresh_for":["Independent review of eventual fixes"],"handover":{"confirmed_facts":["Message 13141 assigns all four composer fixes to 01a1836e-4c16-7770-beb4-c7d300bccb6c; retained GPT-6 Astra xhigh.","Message 13142 assigns investigation only to 01a11d1b-e679-7be3-8f7d-c207f1ab361c; retained GPT-6.1 Sol xhigh.","Both sends succeeded; the archived reopening specialist moved to Now automatically.","Prior autocomplete thread found 91 skills in fresh Codex chats and no loadSkills in SendWorkPalette; findings were included in composer assignment.","Current model discovery advertises both selected models and xhigh reasoning."],"constraints":["Agents answer the user directly; no routine result reply to dispatcher requested.","Composer specialist owns related UI writes; performance work is an investigation and should coordinate any scope need.","Prior mobile fix b50b8c2 has a prepared native app build awaiting a separate installation decision; this does not block new source work."],"open_questions":["Measured cause of the current thread-opening delay remains to be established.","The specialist assignments were queued successfully; successful execution and results remain pending."],"tried_and_failed":["Provider-limits request 70e46b02-0623-4bb1-a935-964046ca3e8a failed with Unknown app control operation; current quota availability is unknown."]},"reason":"This dispatcher retains the assigned specialists, exact requests, settings, and shared-file coordination boundary for these five requests.","recommendation":"reuse","reuse_for":["Route related discoveries and follow-ups to the same two specialists","Resolve ownership or delivery blockers"]}

