{"fresh_for":["Independent validation of the final installed multi-window behavior"],"handover":{"confirmed_facts":["Event 14545 reports notification assignment 14505 turn complete; commit e71033d chooses the most recently focused existing tab owner, otherwise most recently used main window.","Focused native checks passed 4/4 and JavaScript tests 86/86. Full native command_palette_action and test_file_mentions also fail baseline; test_thread_organization_api is flaky under suite load.","Candidate build/notification-routing/Ribbon Field.app is only 0.1.0/build 1; specialist reported installed 0.1.3/build 5 lacks the fix.","Specialist admitted skipping required plugin refresh; follow-up 14549 directs completing it, preparing a newer candidate, coordinating rollout, and verifying installed behavior.","Responsiveness owner 52aed1b1-0d0b-4655-8deb-6ae679066bed had announced build 8 rollout; subsequent notification build must coordinate and use a newer identity.","Event 14545 silently acknowledged; inbox --unread returned empty."],"constraints":["Do not waive plugin refresh because desktop bundles assets.","Do not claim full test suite success or installed activation yet.","Compatible local interface replacement is within desktop-fix task; do not ask again solely because the interface is running.","Preserve active agents, installation capabilities, and runtime compatibility; avoid competing installers.","New dispatcher-created agents use --yolo. Lead-succession assignment remains discussion-only."],"open_questions":["Final coordinated build/version, required refresh verification, and installed notification behavior remain pending.","Any backend payload in the assembled performance build may await idle handover; inspect actual runtime status before claiming activation."],"tried_and_failed":["Notification agent stopped at an installation question before completing required refresh or preparing an upgrade-version candidate."]},"reason":"This dispatcher reviewed the result against requirements and retains the specific missing steps and concurrent rollout coordination.","recommendation":"reuse","reuse_for":["Handle notification fix follow-up completion","Coordinate performance/notification rollout ownership"]}

