{"fresh_for":["Independent end-to-end performance validation"],"handover":{"confirmed_facts":["Created ed695f49-366e-4612-8a51-81bebbf7e2ce (End app-wide latency), Claude Opus 5.5 xhigh, yolo=true; assignment 14625; subscription app-agent:14625.","User reports Enter-to-visible-message delay of roughly 1\u20132 seconds and nearly three hours lost to slow app/backend changes interrupting workflows while Runpod GPUs cost money.","New agent must read /Users/walle/.agents/skills/bitter-lesson/SKILL.md before investigation/scoping; parent read it and included exact requirement.","Message 14624 asks UI agent 51939cf2-c67a-4297-92be-2457306bd9e5 to fix inability to click other conversation side-panel buttons while viewing the agent tree.","Prior responsiveness agent 52aed1b1-0d0b-4655-8deb-6ae679066bed is idle; its latest checkpoint says it handed further backend optimizations to another latency thread for integration."],"constraints":["User wants responsibility for app-wide responsiveness and proactive discovery, not repeated isolated symptom tickets.","Side-panel handoff must stay concise and leave implementation judgment to the agent; no unnecessary detail.","Preserve active agents/GPU workflows; no stopping them or forcing backend handover for testing/activation.","Verify realistic end-to-end latency and actual installed/runtime activation; do not merely mask backend delay.","Future created agents use --yolo; separate lead-succession task remains discussion-only."],"open_questions":["Current cause of send-display latency and other systemic stalls remains to be determined.","Root cause and fix for inaccessible side-panel controls remain pending."],"tried_and_failed":["Earlier responsiveness work has not resolved the user's reported Enter-to-visible delay; new investigation must verify current state rather than assume prior fixes solved it."]},"reason":"This dispatcher retains the user's broader outcome requirement, mandatory skill, minimal-handoff preference, and both verified delivery receipts.","recommendation":"reuse","reuse_for":["Route responsiveness findings to ed695f49-366e-4612-8a51-81bebbf7e2ce","Route side-panel and orange-attention follow-ups to 51939cf2-c67a-4297-92be-2457306bd9e5"]}

