{"fresh_for":["Independent UI verification with real multi-agent tabs"],"handover":{"confirmed_facts":["Event 14705 reported completion of UI assignment 14618; source commit 9a634e4 is not yet installed.","Cause: tab represented OKC - Lead's needs_action while showing child conversation MoE experts owner running. Lead's pending user request was real.","Fix uses displayed conversation state for tab indicator and places root attention in tooltip/aria-label; agent-tree.css now keeps header actions visible above 1100px.","Chromium/WebKit tests could not reproduce unclickable Agents/Context/close buttons. Hidden header actions were reproduced and fixed.","First full Python suite passed 1745 tests; second had two timing flakes passing alone. Changed plugin files refreshed; concurrently edited ui.py caused unrelated cache verification mismatch.","Follow-up 14711 directs coordinated clean rollout with navigation c8653e0b and latency ed695f49, installed checks, and Dismiss accessibility at intermediate widths.","Event 14705 acknowledged; subsequent inbox --unread returned empty."],"constraints":["Do not claim the original click symptom is reproduced/resolved merely because hidden header controls changed.","Build only agreed committed changes and coordinate release identities; preserve ongoing agents and GPU workflows.","User's fix request covers compatible local installation; do not ask user to solve scope/build coordination.","Current responsiveness owner ed695f49 remains active on app-wide latency; UI owner is 51939cf2-c67a-4297-92be-2457306bd9e5.","Future agents use --yolo; lead-succession remains a separate discussion-only assignment."],"open_questions":["Installed attention/control fix activation remains pending.","Dismiss reachability at 721\u20131100px and original click-report interpretation need verification."],"tried_and_failed":["UI specialist could not reproduce side-panel button click failures with fixtures or read-only live data in Chromium/WebKit.","Initial UI result deferred local rollout to user because other sessions had uncommitted changes; returned to agent coordination."]},"reason":"The dispatcher reviewed the UI evidence and retained the difference between reproduced defects, unconfirmed symptoms, and pending installed verification.","recommendation":"reuse","reuse_for":["Handle UI rollout and verification follow-ups","Coordinate overlapping latency/navigation releases"]}

