{"fresh_for":["Independent review of end-to-end latency measurements"],"handover":{"confirmed_facts":["Event 15122 carries assignment-bound lifecycle report from responsiveness owner ed695f49, checkpoint 11545, original assignment 14625.","Specialist reports installed Ribbon Field 0.1.3 build 16 preserved runtime pid 39713 / instance 0737dd6f through interface installs.","Live Enter-to-visible before: p50 1.39s, max 2.77s. After UI fix: p50 1.9ms, max 7ms. Actual send acceptance remains approximately 0.96s median on old backend.","Active payload 6b590466 (build10), pending 852d522c (build16); backend fixes/search improvements await idle handover.","Committed-code realistic gate: send p50 23/p95 230ms, delivery p50 7ms, list p50 3ms, read p50 35ms, search p50 93ms; these are not post-handover live numbers.","Python suite 1756 OK and JS 989 OK reported. Plugin refresh was deferred due other agents' dirty files.","Follow-up 15125 accepted: durable wait without holding runtime busy, live activation measurements, remaining open/overview stalls, coordinated clean-snapshot refresh. Event acknowledged and inbox empty."],"constraints":["No stopping agents, forced handover, or interruption to paid GPU workflows.","Do not conflate immediate local display with backend acceptance or queued backend code with active code.","Do not waive required plugin refresh or include other owners' unfinished files.","Remaining uncached-open Send gating and overview-before-conversation rendering belong to the original app-wide outcome.","New agents use --yolo; separate lead succession remains discussion-only."],"open_questions":["Post-handover live send/search/open metrics remain unmeasured.","Uncached conversation opening still blocks Send until history loads, and project switch paints full overview before conversation.","At 2x load, measured acceptance p95 is approximately 0.7s; structural shared-process limitations remain to be assessed."],"tried_and_failed":["Specialist rejected per-thread SQLite pooling after measuring no list/detail gain.","Early benchmark replayed all completion events and distorted CPU; corrected cursor and event-driven workload.","Separate outgoing-messages.js failed on old backend's fixed asset list; moved echo implementation into app.js."]},"reason":"This dispatcher retains the measured live UI improvement, exact pending backend payload, and required follow-up boundaries.","recommendation":"reuse","reuse_for":["Handle responsiveness activation/verification results","Route residual latency reports to ed695f49-366e-4612-8a51-81bebbf7e2ce"]}

